# Generated by `npm run docs:openapi` and read by the docs at build time. Regenerated by both
# `dev` and `build`, so the committed source never carries a stale copy.
openapi.json

# Generated by `npm run docs:llms` into `public/`, so Vite copies them into `dist/`. Regenerated
# by `build`, so the committed source never carries a stale copy.
public/llms.txt
public/llms-full.txt

# Written by `npm run release:notes` and read by the release workflow.
release-notes.md

